{"title":"Vulture Meat","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Boneyard Vulture, Giant Vulture</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"boneyard-vulture\" title=\"Boneyard Vulture - dropped it in 3 of 12 looted corpses (1/4)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/848c5b3078e044665e81.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Boneyard Vulture</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"giant-vulture\" title=\"Giant Vulture - dropped it in 1 of 4 looted corpses (1/4)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7eb9b75673d5a4ea01cb.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Giant Vulture</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"vulture-meat\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/cooking\">Cooking</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Used to make</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><a href=\"#/item/cooked-vulture-meat\">Cooked Vulture Meat</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Cooking 35</span></li></ul>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/10b825d499e654c11825.svg\" alt=\"Vulture Meat\"></div><h3>Vulture Meat</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      <tr><th>Used in</th><td>1 recipe</